  "description": "Transport-agnostic AI Security Layer for Bhengu AI.\n      Trust scoring, threat detection, and security directives work across\n      any network transport (WiFi, BLE, NearLink, HTTP, Aether mesh, etc.).\n      For Aether-specific telemetry integration, add Bhengu.AI.Security.Aether.",
